.TH UMOUNT2 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
umount2 \- unmounts a filesystem using linux mnt_* flags, subject to privileges
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/mount.h>
.B int umount2(const char* target, int flags);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Unmounts a filesystem using Linux MNT_* flags, subject to privileges.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR umount2 (2)
